# Allow-list for the image build context (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile in preference to a root .dockerignore).
#
# Everything is excluded first; only what the app needs at runtime is let back
# in. A new secret, database or scratch file therefore stays out by default —
# that is the point. Add a path here only if the running app reads it.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!rxconfig.py
!alembic.ini
!alembic/
!assets/
!bike_tracker/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
# Reflex's frozen JS lockfile — the frontend counterpart of uv.lock.
!reflex.lock/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
assets/external/
